WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.590
Unit thirteen. Worms and Parasites!

2
00:00:04.558 --> 00:00:08.193
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:11.704
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:15.696
Today we learn about Worms and Parasites. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:20.529
Parasite. Say it with me. Parasite!

6
00:00:24.016 --> 00:00:27.682
Worms. Say it with me. Worms!

7
00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:34.412
Shoes. Say it with me. Shoes!

8
00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:41.712
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

9
00:00:45.241 --> 00:00:48.741
Toilet. Say it with me. Toilet!

10
00:00:52.225 --> 00:00:55.892
Clean water. Say it with me. Clean water!

11
00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.792
Deworming. Say it with me. Deworming!

12
00:01:06.293 --> 00:01:10.227
Health worker. Say it with me. Health worker!

13
00:01:13.727 --> 00:01:25.101
Worms are a parasite that can live in the body. Wearing shoes, handwashing, using a toilet, and drinking clean water help prevent them. A health worker may give deworming medicine.

14
00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.475
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.989 --> 00:01:33.206
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.256 --> 00:01:34.406
Shoes!

17
00:01:35.265 --> 00:01:40.520
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:41.720
Deworming!

19
00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:49.589
Did you know? Some worm eggs live in soil, so wearing shoes outdoors helps protect you!

20
00:01:49.639 --> 00:01:51.917
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.602 --> 00:02:00.031
Think and answer. How do shoes help prevent worms?

22
00:02:00.081 --> 00:02:01.231
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.408 --> 00:02:07.312
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.362 --> 00:02:10.024
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

